      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The FDA has approved a topical 8% patch formulation of capsaicin (Qutenza-NeurogesX), available only by prescription, for local treatment of postherpetic neuralgia. Postherpetic neuralgia occurs after herpes zoster in about one third of patients ≥60 years old and can persist for months or even years."},
